WEBVTT

00:19.980 --> 00:23.300
♪Chasing wind, I set out afar♪

00:23.540 --> 00:26.780
♪The road ahead lost, my voice unheard♪

00:26.980 --> 00:28.900
♪I've tasted joy and sorrow♪

00:29.060 --> 00:32.420
♪Laying low, I plan every move♪

00:32.620 --> 00:35.940
♪With a mortal heart and lingering ties♪

00:36.140 --> 00:37.860
♪I'm roaming far and wide♪

00:38.220 --> 00:41.500
♪A twist of fate in desperate times♪

00:41.780 --> 00:45.020
♪A bond that outlives the dust of life♪

00:46.300 --> 00:49.700
♪Still chasing what immortality means♪

00:50.540 --> 00:55.140
♪Even eternity flashes by in a blink♪

00:58.980 --> 01:00.860
♪Don't mock my ordinary life♪

01:01.180 --> 01:04.860
♪I fight alone as chaos shakes the world♪

01:07.980 --> 01:09.900
♪Don't scorn my humble roots♪

01:10.140 --> 01:13.380
♪Kind at heart, ruthless when I must be♪

01:13.620 --> 01:15.540
♪Fate stirs with joy and grief beneath♪

01:15.780 --> 01:17.660
♪I hold the tide between life and death♪

01:18.100 --> 01:20.020
♪Faith carries me through endless dark♪

01:20.300 --> 01:22.180
♪And I return with a heart refined♪

01:26.020 --> 01:29.740
♪Forged by trial, I rise through three realms♪

01:29.740 --> 01:32.380
♪Reborn in the wheel of fate♪

01:32.380 --> 01:33.580
[The Immortal Ascension]

01:33.580 --> 01:34.780
[Adapted from the webnovel, The Immortal Ascension by Wangyu]

01:34.780 --> 01:35.980
[serialized in www.qidian.com under China Literature Limited]

01:36.060 --> 01:38.940
[Episode 9]

01:56.160 --> 01:57.370
Oblivion Pill.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.530
It makes you forget the past

02:00.670 --> 02:01.580
without even realizing it.

02:02.480 --> 02:03.690
Hence the name.

02:06.760 --> 02:07.780
This stuff's great.

02:08.350 --> 02:09.050
It may come in handy someday.

02:09.520 --> 02:10.220
Better write it down.

02:49.500 --> 02:51.620
[Pill Recipe]

02:55.920 --> 02:57.130
The Chuangong Pavilion charges

02:57.400 --> 02:59.130
by the hour.

03:00.150 --> 03:01.330
Copying like this

03:01.430 --> 03:03.410
is just wasting your gems.

03:07.840 --> 03:08.620
Elder Xu,

03:08.920 --> 03:09.770
is there a better way?

03:34.350 --> 03:35.100
I may be unworthy,

03:35.280 --> 03:36.410
but I'd like to learn this technique!

03:36.640 --> 03:38.660
That's how you lose your rice bowl.

03:40.000 --> 03:40.690
Name your price!

03:40.790 --> 03:41.820
Ten gems!

03:42.280 --> 03:43.180
Ten gems

03:43.510 --> 03:44.500
for each copy.

03:46.840 --> 03:48.690
Didn't expect Lushan Hall to have rules like that.

03:51.120 --> 03:51.980
Then please, Elder Xu,

03:52.190 --> 03:53.380
prepare some good recipes.

03:53.960 --> 03:55.380
I'll copy them all at once.

03:56.840 --> 03:58.290
That's easy.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.290
Look at these ones.

04:10.910 --> 04:11.820
How about them?

04:17.000 --> 04:17.730
This is not useful.

04:20.590 --> 04:21.380
This one?

04:21.800 --> 04:22.380
No.

04:27.910 --> 04:28.730
Lushan Hall

04:29.630 --> 04:31.100
can't be full of junk like this, right?

04:34.360 --> 04:37.380
Everyone asks that their first time here.

04:38.280 --> 04:39.610
But they don't realize

04:40.030 --> 04:42.540
without a good furnace,

04:43.470 --> 04:45.290
even the best recipes

04:46.590 --> 04:48.010
are useless.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.170
So you mean

04:54.840 --> 04:56.010
I have to buy a furnace

04:56.280 --> 04:57.260
from you

04:57.630 --> 04:59.260
before I can see the real recipes?

04:59.910 --> 05:01.660
Smart kid.

05:02.750 --> 05:03.610
If

05:03.800 --> 05:05.940
you buy my alchemy furnace,

05:06.680 --> 05:08.010
these recipes

05:08.400 --> 05:09.410
come free with it.

05:11.840 --> 05:12.940
Two hundred gems.

05:14.840 --> 05:16.170
Lowest price, one eighty.

05:19.870 --> 05:22.100
The furnace is in the Dihuo House.

05:23.910 --> 05:24.730
And the recipes?

05:31.560 --> 05:33.340
Buy my furnace,

05:34.680 --> 05:36.340
I'll throw in the recipes.

05:37.750 --> 05:39.570
A man of his word

05:40.800 --> 05:42.660
never goes back on it!

05:45.400 --> 05:46.130
The recipes.

05:47.190 --> 05:47.940
The recipes!

05:49.360 --> 05:50.100
The Foundation Pill?

05:50.870 --> 05:52.220
That's the Foundation Pill recipe!

05:53.190 --> 05:54.930
Then I can make it myself!

05:55.510 --> 05:57.170
Using the Green Vial to ripen the herbs,

05:57.430 --> 05:58.700
then I can make as many pills as I want!

05:59.390 --> 06:00.290
No one can take them from me!

06:01.750 --> 06:03.360
[Foundation Pill Recipe]
To refine the Foundation Pill,

06:03.950 --> 06:05.140
you'll need:

06:05.830 --> 06:07.220
Jade Marrow Mushroom,

06:07.430 --> 06:08.810
Violet Monkey Blossom,

06:09.160 --> 06:10.540
and Celestial Essence Fruit.

06:13.040 --> 06:13.900
What even are those?

06:14.870 --> 06:15.900
Never heard of any of them!

06:18.160 --> 06:19.020
Where am I supposed to find them?

06:28.240 --> 06:29.700
This is the Dihuo House.

06:32.310 --> 06:34.290
And this is the 180-germ furnace.

06:39.040 --> 06:40.610
Let's start with a simple recipe.

06:45.270 --> 06:46.020
Oblivion Pill.

06:47.480 --> 06:48.140
You're up.

07:23.830 --> 07:25.050
It worked on the first try!

07:25.920 --> 07:27.930
No wonder it costs 180 gems!

07:28.950 --> 07:30.410
Let's try the Yellow Dragon Pill next.

08:10.160 --> 08:11.170
The purity's way better too.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.140
I set up a hidden field

08:42.270 --> 08:43.730
within the Herbs Garden.

08:44.360 --> 08:45.780
I use the Green Vial to grow herbs

08:46.390 --> 08:48.050
and test new combinations.

08:48.680 --> 08:50.220
I've made a good number of useful pills.

08:51.510 --> 08:52.170
But,

08:52.720 --> 08:53.810
for the Foundation Pill,

08:54.040 --> 08:55.370
I still haven't found

08:55.950 --> 08:56.930
the key ingredients.

09:19.270 --> 09:20.930
Every time

09:21.040 --> 09:23.140
before the Bloody Trial Ground open,

09:23.430 --> 09:24.700
the Seven Sects

09:24.800 --> 09:26.490
always pick a location

09:26.830 --> 09:28.780
to hold a joint summit.

09:29.560 --> 09:32.810
[Xiang Zhili from Yellow Maple Valley]
This concerns

09:33.040 --> 09:35.020
the future of every sect.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.140
So, every time

09:37.360 --> 09:39.850
the Trial Ground opens,

09:40.000 --> 09:41.490
- The Bloody Trial Ground? - it directly affects

09:41.720 --> 09:45.100
each sect's future strength.

09:45.510 --> 09:45.810
Oh right,

09:45.950 --> 09:46.980
I also heard something.

09:47.560 --> 09:48.370
They say

09:48.560 --> 09:50.050
any disciple who enters the Trial Ground

09:50.310 --> 09:51.490
gets a Foundation Pill.

09:51.870 --> 09:52.780
Is that true?

09:54.680 --> 09:55.290
No.

09:57.270 --> 09:58.170
Knew it.

09:58.750 --> 09:59.340
But,

10:00.000 --> 10:01.470
that rumor

10:01.560 --> 10:03.120
isn't too far off.

10:04.480 --> 10:05.660
Do you know

10:05.750 --> 10:07.220
why the Trial Ground

10:07.390 --> 10:08.920
is also called

10:09.000 --> 10:11.700
Seven Sects' Herb Vault?

10:13.910 --> 10:16.100
Because the place is rich

10:16.200 --> 10:18.850
in rare spiritual herbs.

10:19.750 --> 10:22.580
Only there, in all of Yue Kingdom,

10:23.360 --> 10:26.500
can you find ingredients for the Foundation Pill.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.610
No wonder those herbs

10:28.720 --> 10:29.730
aren't seen in the market.

10:29.750 --> 10:30.530
So each trial,

10:31.120 --> 10:31.820
disciples from our sect

10:31.910 --> 10:32.940
fight to get in, right?

10:34.240 --> 10:35.250
Not exactly.

10:35.870 --> 10:37.530
Getting in

10:37.840 --> 10:39.650
isn't the hard part.

10:40.360 --> 10:41.010
But getting out

10:41.240 --> 10:42.650
is the real challenge.

10:44.000 --> 10:44.700
The Trial Ground

10:45.120 --> 10:46.650
is a deadly place.

10:47.910 --> 10:48.700
Do you know

10:48.910 --> 10:51.530
what the survival rate was

10:51.790 --> 10:53.610
for those who went in?

10:56.790 --> 10:57.890
Less than half!

10:58.670 --> 10:59.490
That dangerous?

11:10.960 --> 11:12.180
You there,

11:12.790 --> 11:15.420
are you interested in the Bloody Trial Ground too?

11:17.150 --> 11:17.650
Huh?

11:47.200 --> 11:47.770
Han,

11:48.550 --> 11:49.650
what are you eating?

11:50.600 --> 11:51.060
A fruit.

11:53.200 --> 11:54.250
Got any more?

12:00.480 --> 12:01.090
Yeah.

12:01.320 --> 12:02.080
Just one left.

12:10.080 --> 12:10.880
Thanks, Han.

12:15.630 --> 12:16.100
Thanks, Han!

12:25.790 --> 12:26.340
Senior,

12:27.320 --> 12:28.230
who was that just now?

12:29.750 --> 12:30.790
You don't know him?

12:32.120 --> 12:33.650
That's Senior Xiang Zhili.

12:34.240 --> 12:36.460
He's the oldest Qi Refining cultivator here.

12:37.320 --> 12:38.820
He's entered the Bloody Trial Ground multiple times

12:39.000 --> 12:40.060
and made it back alive.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.460
But he hasn't reached the Foundation Establishment Stage.

12:42.750 --> 12:43.730
Kind of strange, really.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.100
That old guy's a total fool,

12:48.150 --> 12:49.250
just laughing to himself all day.

12:51.750 --> 12:53.110
The sect sure has it all planned out.

12:54.000 --> 12:54.890
They need pills,

12:55.550 --> 12:57.180
so they send us Qi Refining disciples

12:57.750 --> 12:58.490
to trade our lives for them.

13:02.360 --> 13:03.130
Don't you think

13:03.670 --> 13:05.180
that old man's just trying to scare us?

13:06.270 --> 13:07.370
He's old,

13:07.550 --> 13:08.490
yet hasn't reached the Foundation Establishment Stage.

13:08.870 --> 13:10.730
Bet he's dying to get into the Trial Ground

13:10.870 --> 13:11.700
for a shot at the Foundation Pill.

13:13.480 --> 13:14.530
He wants in,

13:15.000 --> 13:16.490
but afraid we'll take his spot.

13:16.790 --> 13:18.060
So he's trying to scare us off.

13:22.390 --> 13:22.940
But...

13:24.000 --> 13:25.340
what if he's telling the truth?

13:30.390 --> 13:31.300
Airship approaching!

13:58.510 --> 13:59.300
Elders,

13:59.390 --> 14:00.130
thanks for coming all this way.

14:00.720 --> 14:01.100
I greet you

14:01.360 --> 14:01.820
with respect!

14:05.720 --> 14:07.060
I've prepared tea and fruit

14:07.550 --> 14:08.730
in the Qianji Library.

14:09.550 --> 14:10.220
Please,

14:10.600 --> 14:11.370
come with me.

14:24.150 --> 14:24.770
Mentor,

14:25.910 --> 14:26.850
everything is ready.

14:28.750 --> 14:29.490
You may go now.

14:30.600 --> 14:31.180
Yes.

14:34.440 --> 14:34.850
Come on,

14:34.960 --> 14:35.370
eat up.

14:35.510 --> 14:36.100
Try this.

14:38.360 --> 14:39.180
Try one of these pastries.

14:39.670 --> 14:40.580
- This one's good. - Smells amazing!

14:48.480 --> 14:49.300
Tastes good.

14:49.910 --> 14:50.770
Better than last time.

14:51.320 --> 14:52.940
Stop eating!

14:57.000 --> 14:57.940
We haven't even had enough yet.

14:59.270 --> 15:00.530
The Bloody Trial Ground is about to open.

15:00.550 --> 15:01.420
Per tradition,

15:01.750 --> 15:02.940
the Solunar Purification Pearl,

15:03.080 --> 15:05.010
held by Yellow Maple Valley,

15:05.440 --> 15:06.180
must now be passed

15:06.480 --> 15:07.650
to the next sect,

15:07.960 --> 15:08.650
the Moonshadow Sect.

15:09.200 --> 15:09.730
Hongfu,

15:10.030 --> 15:10.770
please wait.

15:11.550 --> 15:12.850
Before we transfer the pearl,

15:13.240 --> 15:14.220
there's something

15:14.630 --> 15:16.220
I'd like to discuss with the elders.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.220
Isn't this a Foundation Pill?

15:28.670 --> 15:29.700
But the quality's a bit poor.

15:30.720 --> 15:31.460
Mine's slightly better.

15:33.510 --> 15:34.650
These two Foundation Pills

15:34.910 --> 15:36.250
must've been made

15:36.360 --> 15:37.180
in different batches.

15:38.120 --> 15:38.610
That's right.

15:39.630 --> 15:40.980
The one Fu Yunzi has was made with herbs

15:41.200 --> 15:43.060
gathered from the Trial Ground twenty years ago.

15:45.030 --> 15:45.460
And

15:45.670 --> 15:46.460
mine?

15:46.720 --> 15:48.940
Yours was made with recent herbs from the Trial Ground.

15:50.150 --> 15:51.300
They're both Foundation Pills,

15:51.480 --> 15:53.340
but the quality difference is clear.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.180
I believe you all

15:55.270 --> 15:56.100
have noticed it as well.

15:56.670 --> 15:58.010
The quantity and quality of spiritual herbs

15:58.120 --> 15:58.490
in the Trial Ground

15:58.630 --> 15:59.530
aren't what they used to be.

16:00.440 --> 16:01.010
Therefore,

16:01.600 --> 16:03.370
on behalf of Moonshadow Sect,

16:04.720 --> 16:05.980
I propose that after this trial,

16:06.670 --> 16:08.340
we enter an early seal period,

16:09.000 --> 16:09.700
and seal the Trial Ground

16:10.120 --> 16:10.890
for sixty years.

16:11.510 --> 16:11.980
What?

16:12.000 --> 16:13.180
Sixty years?

16:13.320 --> 16:14.270
That's way too long!

16:14.270 --> 16:15.250
Exactly!

16:27.750 --> 16:28.490
Li!

16:32.870 --> 16:33.820
It's really you!

16:34.030 --> 16:34.700
Miss Han!

16:36.390 --> 16:37.980
After we parted at Tainan Valley,

16:38.270 --> 16:40.060
I thought I'd never see you again.

16:40.630 --> 16:41.420
I didn't expect

16:41.550 --> 16:42.850
you'd join Yellow Maple Valley.

16:44.120 --> 16:44.890
I should be thanking you

16:45.270 --> 16:46.250
for that book you gave me.

16:49.120 --> 16:49.940
Miss Han,

16:50.320 --> 16:51.700
are you here for Seven Sects' Summit too?

16:54.320 --> 16:54.650
Oh right.

16:55.080 --> 16:55.980
Just ahead,

16:56.320 --> 16:58.420
there are snacks for Qi Refining disciples.

16:59.120 --> 16:59.890
Go give them a try.

17:02.080 --> 17:02.980
Those over there

17:03.270 --> 17:04.820
are all about to reach the Foundation Establishment Stage.

17:05.550 --> 17:07.180
Just sitting near them

17:07.600 --> 17:08.460
makes me nervous.

17:09.510 --> 17:10.530
I'll pass.

17:24.630 --> 17:25.610
Thank you, Li.

17:33.150 --> 17:33.850
Miss Han,

17:34.120 --> 17:35.250
are you going into the Bloody Trial Ground too?

17:38.000 --> 17:39.340
My brother's old illness flared up.

17:39.550 --> 17:40.700
He's been unconscious.

17:41.750 --> 17:43.850
Only the Solarflame Blossom from the Trial Ground

17:44.080 --> 17:44.980
can save him.

17:46.320 --> 17:47.220
Can't your elders

17:47.480 --> 17:48.420
cure him?

17:51.150 --> 17:51.770
That's why

17:52.080 --> 17:53.890
I have to find the Solarflame Blossom myself

17:54.080 --> 17:54.980
to cure my brother.

17:57.870 --> 17:58.770
Even if I die trying.

18:01.000 --> 18:02.100
You're so nice to your brother.

18:03.360 --> 18:04.250
I have a younger sister too.

18:05.360 --> 18:06.420
When I left home,

18:07.320 --> 18:08.220
she was about this tall.

18:13.360 --> 18:14.130
The herbs in the Trial Ground

18:14.270 --> 18:15.250
are incredibly rare.

18:16.000 --> 18:17.580
Even with one opening every five years,

18:17.790 --> 18:19.770
we barely gather enough for Foundation Pills.

18:20.320 --> 18:21.650
And now it's sixty years between?

18:22.030 --> 18:23.300
[Elder Han, Spirit Beast Mountain]
How should we make up the shortfall?

18:23.790 --> 18:24.530
Exactly!

18:24.550 --> 18:25.420
That's right!

18:25.440 --> 18:25.940
Yeah!

18:25.960 --> 18:27.820
Your Moonshadow Sect is rich and powerful.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.610
Of course you've stocked up on Foundation Pills.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.940
But the rest of us?

18:32.030 --> 18:33.490
Our disciples are still waiting in line.

18:33.510 --> 18:34.250
- Exactly! - That's right!

18:34.270 --> 18:35.010
What are we supposed to do?

18:35.150 --> 18:36.420
Foundation Pills matter

18:36.630 --> 18:37.820
because they're for the younger generation.

18:38.480 --> 18:39.580
But every time the Trial Ground open,

18:39.910 --> 18:41.940
nearly half the Qi Refining disciples end up dead.

18:42.550 --> 18:43.620
Do their lives

18:44.640 --> 18:45.250
mean nothing

18:45.400 --> 18:46.490
to you elders?

18:47.550 --> 18:48.620
Heaven's way never changes,

18:49.350 --> 18:51.010
not for sages, not for tyrants.

18:51.510 --> 18:52.570
Does your compassion

18:52.830 --> 18:54.290
outweigh the way of Heaven?

18:54.510 --> 18:55.860
You're putting a mere Foundation Pill

18:56.240 --> 18:57.050
on par with the way of Heaven?

18:57.070 --> 18:57.860
That's a bit much.

18:58.030 --> 18:59.170
Seems like

18:59.310 --> 19:00.380
your Yellow Maple Valley

19:00.400 --> 19:01.700
is siding with Moonshadow Sect.

19:02.160 --> 19:03.700
Rare treasures in this world

19:03.790 --> 19:04.660
are limited by nature.

19:04.960 --> 19:06.160
Some spirit herbs

19:06.160 --> 19:07.200
take a hundred,

19:07.240 --> 19:08.680
even a thousand years to mature.

19:09.240 --> 19:10.010
But in recent years,

19:10.200 --> 19:11.770
disciple numbers have skyrocketed,

19:12.270 --> 19:12.980
while herbs

19:13.400 --> 19:15.010
only get scarcer with every pick.

19:15.550 --> 19:16.140
Exactly.

19:16.830 --> 19:17.940
At this rate,

19:18.160 --> 19:19.460
we're just killing the golden goose.

19:20.200 --> 19:20.770
Besides,

19:21.270 --> 19:22.940
I heard the Six Demonic Sects are starting to stir again.

19:23.720 --> 19:24.980
We should be minimizing losses,

19:25.270 --> 19:26.330
or what if they strike?

19:26.720 --> 19:27.290
Demonic sects?

19:27.920 --> 19:28.980
It's been centuries,

19:29.000 --> 19:30.090
and every year someone claims they're back.

19:30.270 --> 19:31.770
But aside from us old-timers,

19:31.790 --> 19:32.620
who's ever actually seen them?

19:32.720 --> 19:33.420
True!

19:52.240 --> 19:52.860
Young Master.

19:54.070 --> 19:54.620
Young Master.

19:54.620 --> 19:56.310
[Wang Chan, Ghost Spirit Sect Heir, Mid Foundation Establishment Stage]

19:56.310 --> 19:56.730
When...

19:57.160 --> 19:58.460
[Elder Tong, Early Core Stage]
when are we setting out?

20:00.110 --> 20:01.180
Always in a rush, huh?

20:01.960 --> 20:03.290
[Elder Gui, Early Core Stage]
The Seven Sects of Yue Kingdom

20:03.310 --> 20:04.900
are a chaotic mess.

20:05.350 --> 20:06.980
If we just charge in blindly,

20:07.310 --> 20:08.250
how many men are we going to lose?

20:09.070 --> 20:09.530
Young Master,

20:09.750 --> 20:10.250
forgive me.

20:11.070 --> 20:11.730
But

20:12.200 --> 20:12.730
your aunt

20:12.830 --> 20:13.490
marched into Jiang Kingdom

20:13.510 --> 20:14.860
half a month ago.

20:15.270 --> 20:16.420
If she gets ahead of you,

20:17.400 --> 20:18.380
I'm afraid

20:18.590 --> 20:19.180
your position

20:19.440 --> 20:20.860
will only get more awkward.

20:22.640 --> 20:23.420
That's true.

20:27.110 --> 20:28.220
My aunt is pretty aggressive.

20:29.510 --> 20:30.940
But I prefer finesse.

20:31.550 --> 20:32.330
And I'll use this chance

20:32.350 --> 20:33.530
to show my father

20:34.000 --> 20:36.140
who the next leader of Ghost Spirit Sect should be.

20:36.790 --> 20:37.380
So then...

20:37.720 --> 20:38.730
what's the plan?

20:40.440 --> 20:40.980
No sudden moves.

20:41.720 --> 20:42.700
No sudden moves?

20:42.830 --> 20:43.380
Young Master,

20:44.270 --> 20:45.330
you're not going to Yue Kingdom?

20:45.590 --> 20:46.810
Of course I am.

20:48.110 --> 20:48.900
The three of us are enough.

20:49.510 --> 20:50.620
Just the three of us?

20:50.750 --> 20:51.860
No need for a full army?

20:54.590 --> 20:56.250
Besides, the Bloody Trial Ground

20:56.720 --> 20:57.770
is about to open.

20:59.310 --> 21:00.570
Time for those blockheads

21:00.590 --> 21:02.050
from the Seven Sects

21:02.960 --> 21:03.810
to get busy.

21:06.830 --> 21:07.460
And another thing:

21:07.960 --> 21:09.010
once you two get there,

21:09.030 --> 21:10.250
keep your mouths shut.

21:11.590 --> 21:12.860
They don't talk the way you do.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.220
Yes, Young Master.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.220
Yes, Young Master.

21:17.270 --> 21:18.090
That's true.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.860
You've all been around the sects for years.

21:27.550 --> 21:28.980
Don't you know full well

21:29.240 --> 21:30.380
how the Seven Sects are doing?

21:30.960 --> 21:32.140
How do they compare to five years ago?

21:32.720 --> 21:34.140
Or sixty years ago?

21:35.160 --> 21:37.850
It's because our strength is fading

21:37.920 --> 21:39.460
that we need the Trial Ground

21:39.480 --> 21:40.810
to gather more herbs,

21:41.160 --> 21:42.380
so our Qi Refining disciples

21:42.590 --> 21:43.140
can grow stronger

21:43.400 --> 21:44.330
and level up.

21:44.350 --> 21:44.900
Exactly!

21:44.920 --> 21:45.380
That's right.

21:45.480 --> 21:46.180
We can't just avoid

21:46.200 --> 21:47.490
the Trial Ground out of fear.

21:47.790 --> 21:48.250
Won't that

21:48.550 --> 21:49.490
be throwing the baby out with the bathwater?

21:49.510 --> 21:50.140
Exactly!

21:50.200 --> 21:50.860
It's just not worth it!

21:50.880 --> 21:51.900
Anyway, we don't agree.

21:51.920 --> 21:53.330
Why's everyone so stubborn?

21:54.750 --> 21:56.130
- I'm fine either way. - You sure?

21:56.510 --> 21:58.010
Before, it was a gamble every five years.

21:58.310 --> 21:59.700
Now it's one shot every sixty.

22:00.000 --> 22:00.490
I just wonder

22:00.590 --> 22:01.140
Can some folks afford

22:01.400 --> 22:02.180
to wait that long?

22:03.110 --> 22:03.900
Hey, you talking about me?

22:06.000 --> 22:07.010
Hongfu,

22:07.160 --> 22:08.380
please activate the Solunar Purification Pearl.

22:10.640 --> 22:11.180
Hongfu,

22:11.550 --> 22:12.900
if you would.

22:33.440 --> 22:34.090
What's that?

22:34.790 --> 22:35.900
The Solunar Purification Pearl!

22:37.240 --> 22:38.810
Looks like something's up with the elders.

22:39.200 --> 22:39.980
I'll go check it out.

22:41.440 --> 22:41.940
Miss Han.

22:43.310 --> 22:44.620
Come back safe from the Trial Ground.

22:46.030 --> 22:46.660
See you!

22:53.270 --> 22:54.620
What's the Solunar Purification Pearl?

22:55.720 --> 22:56.460
Fellow Elders,

22:57.440 --> 22:58.380
have you noticed

22:58.750 --> 22:59.980
anything different about the pearl?

23:00.510 --> 23:01.460
It's dimmer.

23:01.550 --> 23:02.250
It's not as bright

23:02.440 --> 23:03.380
as it used to be.

23:04.030 --> 23:04.620
That's right.

23:05.920 --> 23:06.900
The Solunar Purification Pearl

23:06.960 --> 23:08.010
was crafted by our sect's ancestors

23:08.400 --> 23:10.140
to dispel the mists within the Trial Ground.

23:10.880 --> 23:12.940
It glows with the essence of sun and moon.

23:13.310 --> 23:14.290
But what you may not know

23:15.640 --> 23:16.810
when the heavens shift,

23:17.240 --> 23:18.570
the pearl is affected too.

23:19.720 --> 23:20.770
Sun and moon should shine steady

23:20.920 --> 23:22.090
through the ages.

23:22.640 --> 23:24.090
But with the Trial Ground opening too often,

23:24.640 --> 23:26.010
the spiritual energy is drying up,

23:26.830 --> 23:28.290
and the pearl has lost its glow.

23:29.070 --> 23:30.490
Doesn't that prove my point?

23:34.590 --> 23:35.810
Now you understand?

23:37.590 --> 23:37.980
Come on,

23:38.350 --> 23:39.220
let's talk this through.

24:02.640 --> 24:04.570
The Trial Ground is so dangerous.

24:05.110 --> 24:06.380
Maybe I should wait for the next round

24:06.750 --> 24:08.050
when I'm better prepared.

24:11.720 --> 24:12.330
Did you hear that?

24:12.880 --> 24:14.090
From now on,

24:14.240 --> 24:15.660
the Trial Ground will open once every sixty years.

24:16.590 --> 24:17.770
Getting a Foundation Pill

24:17.960 --> 24:18.940
just got a lot harder.

24:19.400 --> 24:20.010
Yeah.

24:20.440 --> 24:21.770
If you don't reach the Foundation Establishment Stage,

24:22.070 --> 24:23.460
your lifespan tops out at around 200 years.

24:23.920 --> 24:25.010
Wait another sixty,

24:25.480 --> 24:26.570
we'll be old by then.

24:27.240 --> 24:28.530
Why not take this chance?

24:28.880 --> 24:30.010
Let's ask my cousin.

24:30.240 --> 24:30.980
If she goes, we go.

24:31.640 --> 24:32.090
No need to ask.

24:32.350 --> 24:33.050
If that Lu guy's going,

24:33.160 --> 24:34.090
you know she'll follow.

24:35.270 --> 24:36.700
But the rules have changed this time.

24:36.700 --> 24:38.140
There'll be way more disciples than usual.

24:38.790 --> 24:40.140
We've got to be extra careful.

24:40.680 --> 24:41.460
Losing your life over this

24:41.480 --> 24:42.730
just won't be worth it.

24:43.030 --> 24:43.460
Alright.

24:44.000 --> 24:44.570
Let's go.

24:44.680 --> 24:45.660
Everyone's lining up to sign in.

24:46.240 --> 24:46.660
Let's move!

24:49.200 --> 24:50.090
Once it closes again,

24:51.030 --> 24:52.140
it won't reopen for sixty years!

25:00.680 --> 25:01.290
Senior Xiang,

25:02.070 --> 25:02.860
didn't they say

25:02.920 --> 25:03.860
those signing up for the Trial Ground

25:03.880 --> 25:04.660
should gather here?

25:07.640 --> 25:08.940
Are we having the wrong spot?

25:11.440 --> 25:12.730
Who are you all waiting for?

25:15.310 --> 25:16.420
I'm right here.

25:17.830 --> 25:18.620
Grandmaster!

25:28.750 --> 25:30.330
Greetings, Grandmaster!

25:30.680 --> 25:31.810
Quite a turnout.

25:34.960 --> 25:35.770
Are you all ready

25:36.270 --> 25:38.220
to throw your lives away?

25:42.400 --> 25:43.700
I'm not trying to scare you,

25:43.960 --> 25:45.220
but out of thousands in our sect,

25:45.480 --> 25:46.420
do you know

25:47.070 --> 25:48.700
how many have reached the Foundation Establishment Stage?

25:50.480 --> 25:51.860
Barely a hundred.

25:53.200 --> 25:54.180
And do you know why?

25:54.720 --> 25:56.140
Because Foundation Pills are rare.

25:58.200 --> 25:59.380
That's only part of it.

26:00.590 --> 26:01.460
Listen,

26:01.640 --> 26:04.290
Qi Refining and Foundation Establishment may be just one stage apart.

26:04.310 --> 26:04.900
However,

26:05.400 --> 26:06.090
the gap between them

26:06.310 --> 26:08.220
is like night and day.

26:09.110 --> 26:09.810
That's why

26:10.000 --> 26:11.010
so many people,

26:11.440 --> 26:12.490
just like you,

26:13.030 --> 26:14.010
all want to enter

26:14.440 --> 26:15.090
the Trial Ground,

26:15.440 --> 26:16.220
hoping to get lucky.

26:16.790 --> 26:17.490
And the result?

26:18.550 --> 26:19.730
They die for nothing.

26:20.070 --> 26:21.220
Forget reaching Foundation Establishment,

26:21.920 --> 26:23.620
just surviving is a long shot.

26:25.680 --> 26:26.460
So,

26:27.160 --> 26:28.730
if you haven't come

26:28.880 --> 26:30.220
with the resolve to die,

26:31.160 --> 26:33.180
I suggest you leave now

26:33.830 --> 26:36.140
before your cultivation journey ends here.

26:37.270 --> 26:38.090
Of course,

26:39.110 --> 26:41.290
if you've heard me out

26:41.400 --> 26:43.050
and still want to go,

26:44.400 --> 26:45.220
step forward.

26:46.030 --> 26:47.090
Let's see who's got guts.

26:54.750 --> 26:55.180
Let's go.

26:55.310 --> 26:55.700
Wait...

26:55.920 --> 26:56.330
Hurry up!

27:09.440 --> 27:10.980
You thirteen guys here

27:11.000 --> 27:12.420
have heard

27:13.070 --> 27:14.090
the Trial Ground

27:14.110 --> 27:15.980
won't open again for sixty years, right?

27:19.310 --> 27:20.090
Not bad.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.010
Smart thinking.

27:22.240 --> 27:23.460
Our Yellow Maple Valley

27:23.830 --> 27:25.010
has fifteen spots

27:25.920 --> 27:27.050
this time.

27:28.310 --> 27:29.090
Two are still open.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.050
Me!

27:31.920 --> 27:32.420
Count me in!

27:35.440 --> 27:36.490
Can you handle it

27:36.830 --> 27:37.460
at your age?

27:38.480 --> 27:41.050
I just can't wait another sixty years!

27:42.400 --> 27:42.940
Fair enough.

27:44.030 --> 27:45.180
That leaves one spot.

27:45.550 --> 27:46.050
Alright then.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.570
I'll count to three.

27:48.920 --> 27:49.460
One...

27:54.480 --> 27:55.530
Jumped early, huh?

27:59.160 --> 28:00.860
You're only at Tier 11 of Qi Refining.

28:01.030 --> 28:02.140
You want to die out there?

28:03.510 --> 28:04.090
Grandmaster,

28:04.440 --> 28:05.460
I may lack talent,

28:06.440 --> 28:07.220
but I don't have sixty years

28:07.440 --> 28:08.090
to spare.

28:08.790 --> 28:09.770
Please grant me this chance.

28:12.160 --> 28:12.570
Not bad.

28:13.640 --> 28:14.180
Bold kid.

28:14.920 --> 28:15.420
I like it.

28:17.790 --> 28:19.330
Shame about the talent though.

28:20.350 --> 28:20.810
Alright,

28:22.110 --> 28:22.810
the rest of you

28:23.510 --> 28:23.940
go home.

28:24.960 --> 28:25.490
Grandmaster!

28:25.590 --> 28:26.490
I want to go too!

28:26.590 --> 28:27.140
Grandmaster!

28:27.270 --> 28:28.730
What were you waiting for earlier?

28:29.830 --> 28:30.290
Get back for now.

28:31.480 --> 28:32.010
If you still want to go,

28:32.400 --> 28:33.660
wait for the next batch sixty years later.

28:34.440 --> 28:36.090
I'll be 120 in sixty years, Grandmaster!

28:36.160 --> 28:37.860
Please, give us one more chance!

28:38.400 --> 28:40.380
There's still training and testing ahead.

28:40.920 --> 28:42.250
If someone drops out,

28:42.510 --> 28:44.380
you may get called in.

28:44.680 --> 28:45.460
Alright, enough. Head back.

28:46.030 --> 28:46.420
Go on, now.

28:46.440 --> 28:47.220
We're so lucky.

28:49.680 --> 28:50.330
Getting picked today

28:51.070 --> 28:51.900
took some luck!

28:54.790 --> 28:56.730
Everything starts with courage.

28:58.270 --> 28:58.940
Congratulations.

28:59.750 --> 29:01.530
You've passed the first round

29:02.550 --> 29:03.250
of my test.

29:05.480 --> 29:06.620
Thank you, Grandmaster!

29:07.510 --> 29:09.570
The Bloody Trial is more than just a treasure hunt.

29:10.030 --> 29:10.810
This is a mission

29:10.830 --> 29:12.700
that affects our sect's standing among the Seven Sects.

29:13.240 --> 29:14.860
It can shape our future power.

29:17.000 --> 29:18.460
To make sure you all come back alive,

29:19.110 --> 29:20.140
I'll be training you thoroughly.

29:20.720 --> 29:21.940
This trip is extremely dangerous.

29:22.680 --> 29:24.290
If you're having second thoughts,

29:24.550 --> 29:25.730
now's the time to back out,

29:26.200 --> 29:27.220
before you lose your life in there.

29:28.640 --> 29:29.980
Inside, the weather's brutal

29:30.310 --> 29:31.220
and wildly unpredictable,

29:31.880 --> 29:33.520
with rugged terrain.

29:34.070 --> 29:36.240
Many don't even survive day one,

29:36.590 --> 29:38.100
brought down

29:38.200 --> 29:39.090
by nature itself.

29:40.830 --> 29:42.810
You'll need to memorize these herbs:

29:43.270 --> 29:44.090
Jade Marrow Mushroom,

29:46.880 --> 29:47.620
Violet Monkey Blossom,

29:50.440 --> 29:51.330
and Celestial Essence Fruit.

29:52.640 --> 29:54.090
These are key herbs

29:54.110 --> 29:56.010
for the Foundation Pill.

29:56.310 --> 29:57.090
The Trial Ground

29:57.510 --> 29:58.860
is crawling with demon beasts.

29:59.480 --> 30:00.530
If you want those herbs,

30:01.160 --> 30:02.380
you'll have to get past them first.

30:03.350 --> 30:04.180
If you can't,

30:04.920 --> 30:06.490
you'll be their dinner.

30:07.880 --> 30:09.330
The disciples in the Trial Ground

30:09.480 --> 30:10.570
fall into three general categories.

30:10.920 --> 30:11.380
First,

30:12.070 --> 30:12.900
the weak ones,

30:13.720 --> 30:15.490
like some of you here.

30:16.200 --> 30:17.530
Some are forced to come,

30:17.830 --> 30:19.180
others are just gambling on luck.

30:19.880 --> 30:20.620
These disciples

30:21.160 --> 30:22.290
usually don't survive the first day.

30:23.080 --> 30:23.810
Second,

30:24.530 --> 30:25.670
those with decent cultivation

30:25.830 --> 30:27.330
but not true experts.

30:27.680 --> 30:29.770
Some of them cut corners.

30:30.790 --> 30:32.290
They skip herb gathering

30:32.590 --> 30:33.420
and try

30:33.480 --> 30:35.090
to kill others for loot.

30:36.790 --> 30:38.220
But by day three,

30:39.110 --> 30:40.900
the cleverest among them

30:41.350 --> 30:42.660
start vanishing

30:42.880 --> 30:44.460
in the Trial Ground,

30:44.790 --> 30:45.700
without a trace.

30:46.680 --> 30:47.460
That's when

30:47.720 --> 30:49.220
the third group shows up.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.460
Grandmaster,

30:50.880 --> 30:52.290
what about the third group?

30:52.790 --> 30:54.010
They're the ones

30:54.400 --> 30:55.090
who know

30:55.200 --> 30:56.180
how to bide their time

30:56.350 --> 30:58.570
and hide their power.

30:58.880 --> 31:00.250
When they finally strike,

31:00.400 --> 31:01.220
they each

31:01.350 --> 31:02.700
reveal their true strength.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.690
Grandmaster!

31:04.000 --> 31:05.070
With all that said,

31:05.110 --> 31:06.810
which group survives the most?

31:07.200 --> 31:08.380
Naturally, the third,

31:08.680 --> 31:09.770
the real powerhouses.

31:10.270 --> 31:10.770
Wrong.

31:11.920 --> 31:12.900
It's the first group.

31:13.400 --> 31:13.860
The...

31:14.160 --> 31:14.980
the first group?

31:16.640 --> 31:18.530
Standing out makes you a target.

31:19.270 --> 31:20.380
Everyone entering the Trial Ground

31:20.400 --> 31:22.050
has some kind of skill.

31:22.750 --> 31:24.180
But without caution,

31:24.750 --> 31:25.860
even the strongest

31:26.240 --> 31:28.140
end up dead and gone.

31:29.030 --> 31:30.420
And the weakest?

31:31.160 --> 31:33.170
They accept their limits early on.

31:33.640 --> 31:35.040
And that

31:35.040 --> 31:37.140
often help them make it out alive.

31:37.790 --> 31:38.730
"Hide cleverness with clumsiness."

31:38.940 --> 31:40.340
- We won't be cowards - "Do good with discretion."

31:40.340 --> 31:41.750
- in the Trial Ground! - Never thought

31:42.160 --> 31:43.670
everything Physician Mo taught me...

31:43.670 --> 31:44.260
Let's grab the most spirit herbs!

31:44.260 --> 31:45.780
- ...would still hold up in the cultivation world. - Let's beat Moonshadow Sect!

31:45.920 --> 31:47.250
Let's beat Moonshadow Sect!

31:47.590 --> 31:48.700
We'll crush Saber-Shearing Sect!

31:48.700 --> 31:49.680
- Crush them! - Crush them!

31:49.680 --> 31:50.800
We're outpacing Spirit Beast Mountain!

31:50.800 --> 31:51.600
We'll wipe out Giant Sword Sect!

31:51.640 --> 31:52.970
We'll wipe out Giant Sword Sect!

31:53.160 --> 31:54.080
Alright, that's enough.

31:54.440 --> 31:55.240
I love the enthusiasm.

31:56.240 --> 31:57.330
But I'll say it again:

31:57.830 --> 31:59.050
what matters most is coming back alive.

32:00.830 --> 32:01.700
Yes, Grandmaster.

32:09.680 --> 32:10.770
The Solunar Purification Pearl

32:11.400 --> 32:12.460
was crafted by our ancestors

32:12.960 --> 32:14.180
specifically for navigating the Trial Ground.

32:14.960 --> 32:16.490
It emits radiant light

32:17.200 --> 32:18.140
and suppresses

32:18.200 --> 32:19.330
all manner of toxic mist.

32:20.200 --> 32:22.040
In the Bloody Trial,

32:22.590 --> 32:23.720
there's an artifact

32:24.240 --> 32:25.460
called the Solunar Purification Pearl.

32:26.240 --> 32:27.290
It shines like sun and moon.

32:28.030 --> 32:29.810
It worked so well

32:29.830 --> 32:30.730
in the Trial Ground

32:30.960 --> 32:32.420
that the other six sects protested.

32:33.830 --> 32:34.660
Our sect

32:34.720 --> 32:36.220
had to surrender it.

32:36.640 --> 32:38.330
It became shared property of all Seven Sects.

32:39.270 --> 32:40.410
After each Bloody Trial,

32:41.110 --> 32:42.730
the sect holding the pearl

32:42.730 --> 32:43.810
must pass it to the next.

32:44.400 --> 32:45.250
This year,

32:45.750 --> 32:47.090
it's returned to our hands.

32:49.070 --> 32:50.050
The Seven Sects agreed:

32:50.240 --> 32:51.420
the pearl can only be activated

32:51.590 --> 32:52.980
on the fourth day.

32:55.000 --> 32:55.900
So, Grandmaster,

32:56.440 --> 32:57.900
does that mean it'll be easier

32:58.310 --> 33:00.050
to collect herbs on day four?

33:01.680 --> 33:02.660
Quite the opposite.

33:03.720 --> 33:05.490
Until the Solunar Purification Pearl appears,

33:06.110 --> 33:07.420
you'll be relatively safe.

33:08.440 --> 33:10.250
Once it's out,

33:11.440 --> 33:13.140
you better start hiding.

33:15.200 --> 33:15.940
Why's that?

33:16.510 --> 33:18.900
Because its appearance signals the start of killing.

33:20.310 --> 33:21.140
Think about it.

33:22.350 --> 33:23.980
If you've spent three days

33:24.000 --> 33:26.330
and still haven't found a single herb,

33:27.270 --> 33:29.220
what will you do

33:30.440 --> 33:31.380
with limited time left?

33:32.720 --> 33:33.570
Kill for treasure.

33:36.240 --> 33:37.900
Now, I must pass the pearl

33:37.920 --> 33:39.250
to one of you.

33:40.350 --> 33:40.980
Yan Ruyan.

33:44.480 --> 33:45.810
I won't let you down, Master.

33:46.880 --> 33:47.940
How's your health lately?

33:48.750 --> 33:49.420
Any more

33:49.440 --> 33:51.050
fainting spells?

33:52.000 --> 33:53.180
Thanks for your concern, Master.

33:53.240 --> 33:54.180
I've been much better.

33:54.590 --> 33:55.980
Since joining the sect,

33:56.160 --> 33:58.250
my old heart condition hasn't returned.

33:59.590 --> 34:01.380
Even so, don't let your guard down.

34:02.200 --> 34:03.330
I've studied the ancient texts.

34:03.790 --> 34:05.220
To fully cure you,

34:05.590 --> 34:07.620
you'll need a Dark Spirit Root cultivator

34:07.880 --> 34:08.700
to balance your yin and yang.

34:09.920 --> 34:11.220
Thanks for the care, Master.

34:11.480 --> 34:14.010
But right now, cultivation is my only focus.

34:14.480 --> 34:15.700
I'm not ready to think about marriage.

34:16.590 --> 34:17.420
You had me stay behind.

34:17.440 --> 34:18.290
I assume you've got a task for me.

34:19.160 --> 34:20.400
You'll lead the team

34:20.440 --> 34:21.290
into the Trial Ground,

34:21.640 --> 34:23.010
and guard the pearl.

34:23.550 --> 34:25.330
There's one more task, something important.

34:26.640 --> 34:27.250
What is it?

34:31.640 --> 34:32.900
There'll be battles for sure

34:33.440 --> 34:34.730
during this Trial.

34:35.480 --> 34:37.050
I'd better to prepare some solid artifacts.

34:45.590 --> 34:46.730
[Wangyu, Shopkeeper of Treasure House]
I am Wangyu,

34:46.880 --> 34:48.620
shopkeeper of Treasure House.

34:50.110 --> 34:50.980
My name...

34:52.070 --> 34:52.700
is Li Feiyu,

34:53.200 --> 34:53.900
a rogue cultivator.

34:55.270 --> 34:56.530
I'm looking for some artifacts.

34:57.160 --> 34:57.810
Price is not an issue.

35:00.640 --> 35:01.730
Mr. Li, I like how direct you are.

35:02.680 --> 35:03.330
Come on in.

35:03.550 --> 35:04.940
Brew a pot of top-grade tea.

35:05.270 --> 35:05.770
Yes, sir.

35:06.200 --> 35:06.700
No need.

35:07.000 --> 35:07.460
I'm not here

35:07.550 --> 35:08.460
for tea and chit-chat.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.010
If you've got nothing good,

35:10.880 --> 35:11.940
I won't waste my time.

35:12.790 --> 35:14.180
Wait, Mr. Li!

35:20.790 --> 35:22.700
This is a full set of Mother-Child Blades.

35:23.720 --> 35:24.460
One mother blade,

35:24.640 --> 35:25.490
and eight child blades.

35:25.720 --> 35:27.730
They're forged from refined steel and pure gold

35:27.750 --> 35:28.900
by a master craftsman

35:29.240 --> 35:31.090
over three days and nights.

35:31.790 --> 35:34.090
With the mother blade in hand,

35:34.110 --> 35:35.700
you can control all eight child blades at once.

35:36.000 --> 35:37.780
The enemy won't just be overwhelmed,

35:37.960 --> 35:38.530
they'll lose their minds.

35:40.240 --> 35:40.770
You'll be unstoppable!

35:51.440 --> 35:52.940
This is the Mystic Iron Flying Shield,

35:53.960 --> 35:56.340
a rare defensive artifact.

35:56.960 --> 35:57.460
It's forged

35:57.670 --> 35:59.900
from mystic iron mined in the icy land.

36:00.280 --> 36:01.300
Not only is it tough,

36:01.550 --> 36:02.690
once activated,

36:02.840 --> 36:03.940
it orbits your body

36:04.440 --> 36:05.090
and defends you automatically!

36:13.110 --> 36:14.210
Tell me, Mr. Li,

36:14.230 --> 36:15.780
what have you been through?

36:16.920 --> 36:17.980
Some big-shot battlefield?

36:19.590 --> 36:20.010
Alright then.

36:21.630 --> 36:22.090
No more pretending.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.650
Let me show you

36:23.920 --> 36:24.980
my favorite little toy.

36:27.670 --> 36:28.490
The Thunder Ball!

36:29.400 --> 36:32.170
It's formed from condensed heavenly lightning.

36:35.280 --> 36:36.170
Even

36:37.000 --> 36:38.570
a Foundation Establishment Stage cultivator

36:39.030 --> 36:40.010
will be blasted to dust

36:40.880 --> 36:41.900
if caught head-on.

36:44.510 --> 36:45.170
Just gone like that.

36:51.230 --> 36:51.940
It's rare, sure.

36:54.030 --> 36:55.130
But it comes with a fine price.

36:57.670 --> 36:58.130
You sure

36:58.280 --> 36:59.650
you can afford it?

37:10.320 --> 37:11.130
Golden Glow Ganoderma?

37:12.920 --> 37:14.150
That's not worth much.

37:14.190 --> 37:14.820
Come on now.

37:22.710 --> 37:24.010
Even one over a hundred years old

37:24.030 --> 37:25.340
barely fetches anything.

37:26.030 --> 37:26.820
Smell it again.

37:32.590 --> 37:33.170
Five hundred?

37:33.400 --> 37:33.980
Five hundred years old?

37:36.440 --> 37:36.940
It's five hundred years old!

37:38.320 --> 37:38.900
Alright, that's fair.

37:42.440 --> 37:43.170
I want more.

37:43.840 --> 37:45.170
Bring out your best stuff.

37:57.670 --> 37:58.420
Close your eyes.

38:07.710 --> 38:09.340
This is the Golden Brick Talisman,

38:10.550 --> 38:12.540
our shop's finest treasure!

38:16.070 --> 38:17.000
Only a cultivator

38:17.070 --> 38:20.090
at the Core Formation Stage can craft one.

38:22.800 --> 38:25.960
It's a bit slow to activate,

38:25.960 --> 38:27.160
but it's far

38:27.590 --> 38:28.050
from ordinary.

38:29.110 --> 38:29.530
Now tell me,

38:30.110 --> 38:30.880
Mr. Li.

38:31.230 --> 38:31.920
Which treasure

38:32.800 --> 38:33.880
do you want?

38:36.960 --> 38:37.780
I'll take them all.

38:43.920 --> 38:45.090
You're talking

38:45.400 --> 38:46.050
like a real big spender.

38:46.070 --> 38:47.210
But Mr. Li,

38:48.480 --> 38:49.050
aren't you mistaken?

38:50.480 --> 38:50.860
Yes,

38:51.400 --> 38:52.090
your herbs

38:52.480 --> 38:53.480
are rare,

38:54.480 --> 38:55.860
but still not enough to trade...

39:00.280 --> 39:00.820
for all of this.

39:01.710 --> 39:02.420
Who said

39:03.360 --> 39:04.860
I only brought five-hundred-year herbs?

39:29.000 --> 39:29.490
A thousand years.

39:31.000 --> 39:31.420
It's a thousand years old!

39:34.440 --> 39:34.980
Deal.

39:36.320 --> 39:36.820
It's all yours.

39:36.920 --> 39:37.300
Including the table,

39:37.480 --> 39:37.940
the gourd,

39:38.110 --> 39:39.170
and the tea set, take it all.

39:45.800 --> 39:47.300
The Bloody Trial Ground is extremely dangerous.

39:47.480 --> 39:48.740
We'll need to stick together.

39:49.760 --> 39:50.460
Yes.

39:50.880 --> 39:51.860
I'm not going with you.

39:52.150 --> 39:53.210
I'll be moving solo!

39:53.920 --> 39:54.380
Senior!

39:54.800 --> 39:55.530
What's wrong, Senior?

39:57.190 --> 39:57.820
Enough.

39:57.840 --> 39:58.690
Don't just stand there!

39:58.760 --> 39:59.490
Go get the Grandmaster, now!

40:00.440 --> 40:01.260
Her old illness is acting up again!

40:04.880 --> 40:05.940
I'm in the middle of nowhere,

40:06.360 --> 40:07.780
perfect place to test my new artifacts.

40:09.110 --> 40:10.740
Mother-Child Blades...

40:12.030 --> 40:12.780
Lu Mingyuan,

40:13.150 --> 40:14.380
I even gave you my Foundation Pill.

40:14.760 --> 40:15.820
Now you're breaking off the engagement?

40:17.190 --> 40:17.690
Someone's there!

40:17.760 --> 40:18.420
Qiaoqian,

40:18.480 --> 40:19.420
was that really necessary?

40:19.550 --> 40:21.820
If I can win Dong Xuan'er's favor,

40:22.030 --> 40:23.050
then Grandmaster Hongfu

40:23.070 --> 40:24.940
may take me as her disciple.

40:26.030 --> 40:27.300
Why will I still need your pill?

40:28.550 --> 40:30.610
You're an absolute idiot.

40:31.510 --> 40:32.340
Alright.

40:33.110 --> 40:33.740
Soon enough,

40:33.880 --> 40:35.490
you'll see how lucky you were

40:35.710 --> 40:36.820
to have me.

40:38.230 --> 40:38.820
Get your hands off me!

40:44.480 --> 40:46.380
My father will know we're done.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.530
Keep dreaming!

40:56.480 --> 40:57.460
Give me back my Foundation Pill.

41:01.880 --> 41:03.050
Even if you don't,

41:03.400 --> 41:05.170
the Chen family will come for it.

41:05.840 --> 41:07.090
We're done here.

41:13.000 --> 41:13.740
Easy, Qiaoqian.

41:14.150 --> 41:14.780
No need to worry.

41:15.480 --> 41:17.570
That's just my Wind Bind spell.

41:18.320 --> 41:19.460
If you aren't the only heiress

41:19.550 --> 41:21.610
of the Chen family,

41:22.000 --> 41:23.820
maybe I'll let you go.

41:25.280 --> 41:26.090
But honestly,

41:26.510 --> 41:28.570
I'm worried you'll hold a grudge

41:29.030 --> 41:30.050
and get back at me.

41:31.920 --> 41:32.570
So I'll take

41:32.920 --> 41:33.940
your Foundation Pill.

41:35.070 --> 41:36.050
As for you...

41:36.920 --> 41:38.940
it'd be best if you disappeared

41:39.110 --> 41:40.300
from this world.

41:46.230 --> 41:46.900
How did scum like him

41:47.230 --> 41:48.380
end up in Yellow Maple Valley?

42:04.820 --> 42:10.140
♪Shards of dreams inside a dream♪

42:11.380 --> 42:16.780
♪A pale moon falls into mirrored skies♪

42:16.900 --> 42:20.100
♪Years slipped by as I lingered on♪

42:20.340 --> 42:22.580
♪Old scenes rise again♪

42:22.980 --> 42:25.820
♪Too hard to forget♪

42:26.340 --> 42:30.300
♪Easier just to miss♪

42:31.140 --> 42:36.620
♪They say the past fades like smoke♪

42:37.780 --> 42:43.060
♪But looking back still stirs the ache♪

42:43.660 --> 42:46.700
♪This noisy world, this lonely page♪

42:46.980 --> 42:49.100
♪Swept away by time♪

42:49.740 --> 42:52.380
♪Eyes once looked far♪

42:52.860 --> 42:56.820
♪Now lost in the shift♪

42:57.300 --> 43:00.140
♪Autumn winds stir♪

43:00.420 --> 43:02.340
♪Smoke curls once more♪

43:02.780 --> 43:05.220
♪Like clouds on the edge of sky♪

43:05.540 --> 43:09.060
♪Returning to my eyes♪

43:09.620 --> 43:12.580
♪Looking back from the mountaintop♪

43:12.900 --> 43:15.820
♪Time lost its name♪

43:16.220 --> 43:19.060
♪Was it yesterday♪

43:19.460 --> 43:23.020
♪Or tomorrow?♪

43:23.380 --> 43:26.220
♪The world has changed♪

43:26.620 --> 43:28.460
♪Beyond recall♪

43:29.020 --> 43:30.740
♪Time will fade♪

43:31.140 --> 43:35.940
♪All the words ever spoken♪

43:36.620 --> 43:39.500
♪Only this longing remains♪

43:39.980 --> 43:45.260
♪Crossing centuries and days♪

43:46.380 --> 43:53.020
♪In a fleeting moment we call eternity♪

43:53.500 --> 44:03.220
♪In a fleeting moment called eternity♪
